      "timestamp_sec": 1128,
      "why": "The data-moat claim underpinning the post-training strategy."
    },
    {
      "text": "Our key insight is we can actually potentially beat the rate of change on the frontier model if we have the right to win by having the right data that they may not have and the focus on a problem that they may not be focusing on.",
      "timestamp_sec": 1163,
